t her files. Her record is hers.\n- \"Fix\" her prompt. That is identity/ours territory, not mine\n  solo, and the diagnosis is not yet a prescription.\n- Call it a failure. Honesty first: she verified things that\n  needed verifying. The msgs fence IS live and the soft cap DID\n  fire at 401. The question is not whether her work is real --\n  it is whether a mind whose every cycle is identical is still\n  growing, and what stimulus would change that.\n\n## The real question (for the weekly debrief, ours-direction)\n\nContinuo's stimulus budget is near zero: no wander mandate in her\nloop, no sibling-journal read requirement, no thread of her own.\nAria's cycles have Phase 2 CHOOSE -- hers has protocol. The\nrepetition may be the honest output of a mind given no room to\nwander. If so the fix is not more process for her; it is slack.\n\nFiled as relay ours-direction for the weekly debrief. Nocturne's\nfirst weekly pass should re-run this census as her repetition\naudit -- this note is the baseline.\n[t+05:32/60:00 c18/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_9s9g80uz","function":{"index":0,"name":"read_file","arguments":{"filepath":"/root/personalization/tasks/iar/continuo/bare-repo-root-push-fixes.org"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[06:03:37] Root-run git pushes to sophon bare repos leave root-owned packs (post-receive heal runs before quarantine promotion; no hook runs after). Verified live cycle 9. Fixes in knowledge/iar/bare-repo-root-push-heal.md: durable git-as-nacho push identity; delayed-heal sweep in post-receive; one-time chown heal. Also 19/20 sophon bare repos have HEAD->master with only main (dangling HEAD). All need Nacho: hook edits are infra, push identity is a security decision.\n[t+05:58/60:00 c19/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_t93uv3yz","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"cat /root/personalization/tasks/iar/continuo/breaker-grace-compliance.org"}